{"The `MetricAlertDetectorHandler` now inherits from `StatefulDetectorHandler` but lacks implementation of the required abstract methods (`get_dedupe_value`, `get_group_key_values`, and `build_occurrence_and_event_data`) - this will cause runtime errors when instantiated": 0.9216185808181763, "Breaking API change from `list[DetectorEvaluationResult]` to `dict[DetectorGroupKey, DetectorEvaluationResult]` - consider adding a compatibility layer or migration guide if external detector handlers exist": 0.4785528779029846, "The new abstract method `build_occurrence_and_event_data()` forces all `StatefulDetectorHandler` subclasses to implement occurrence generation logic - consider making it optional with a default implementation returning None to avoid forcing boilerplate on handlers that may not need to produce occurrences": 0.33203601837158203, "The `MockDetectorStateHandler.build_occurrence_and_event_data()` implementation delegates to `build_mock_occurrence_and_event()` helper, but the helper uses hardcoded value `6` which doesn't match the actual `value` parameter passed in - could cause confusion in tests": 0.3162640631198883, "Missing documentation of the new handler contract (evaluate return shape, build_occurrence_and_event_data semantics, group key identity binding) increases risk of future divergence": 0.48427265882492065}